  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "这一季大获全胜  (A Clean Sweep This Season)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "agent": "经纪人",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The morning after Bianbian's articles go viral, every talent agency that snubbed Xingtian scrambles to call Xingzi back, insisting their singers clear their schedules to appear on Twelve Singers. Listen to Xingzi, a talent manager, and Kaiwen in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "杏子，十二歌王什么时候续约啊？我们整个经纪团队可都等着呢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "亲爱的何总，咱们之前不是说艺人没档期不续约了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "谁说的呀？我们一直跟你们合作的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我告诉你啊，我们不接任何通告，必须上十二歌王！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "您稍等一下啊。总编室，杏子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "杏子，前两次的沟通啊，我们有点误会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我的妈呀，大获全胜啊这一季！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这些人也太夸张了吧，变得太极端了吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "是啊，辛惠美和黄金一班合体，经纪公司知道的全都扑上来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这一季节目未播先火，我是真没想到。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我是真没想到，辛天后能对咱们总编室的事这么上心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "全都搞定了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "杏子，十二歌王什么时候续约啊？我们整个经纪团队可都等着呢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi, when are we renewing our Twelve Singers contract? Our whole management team is waiting!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "亲爱的何总，咱们之前不是说艺人没档期不续约了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Didn't we hear earlier that your artist had no open dates and wouldn't be renewing?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "谁说的呀？我们一直跟你们合作的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who ever said that? We have always partnered closely with you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我告诉你啊，我们不接任何通告，必须上十二歌王！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me tell you, we're turning down every other booking — our singer must be on Twelve Singers!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "您稍等一下啊。总编室，杏子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please hold for just a moment. Chief editor's office, Xingzi speaking.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "杏子，前两次的沟通啊，我们有点误会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi, there was a tiny misunderstanding in our last two conversations!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我的妈呀，大获全胜啊这一季！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh my goodness — this season is a total landslide victory!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这些人也太夸张了吧，变得太极端了吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'These people are outrageous — talk about a complete one-eighty!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "是啊，辛惠美和黄金一班合体，经纪公司知道的全都扑上来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right — once word got out that Xin Huimei and the Golden Class were reuniting, every agency came rushing over.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这一季节目未播先火，我是真没想到。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This season is already red-hot before airing a single frame; I truly didn't see this coming.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我是真没想到，辛天后能对咱们总编室的事这么上心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And I never imagined a superstar like Xin Huimei would care so deeply about our office's project.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "全都搞定了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every last obstacle is settled!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
