    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Marveling at how Xin Huimei's Golden Class reunion made Twelve Singers a smash hit before a single episode aired, Xingzi and Kaiwen celebrate clearing the final hurdle. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
